  "published": "2026-08-26T02:28:09.74Z",
  "releaseNotes": "TCMProject.Web: re-pack of the ClockSkew=60s fix (26.8.26.1) with a LOWER dependency floor. 26.8.26.1 was packed against the repo's then-current pins and ended up requiring TCMProject.Common >= 26.8.25.1 and TCMProject.Utilities >= 26.8.22.1, which forced a Common/Utilities upgrade on consumers that pin them lower (NU1605 downgrade at restore). The Web code does not use anything newer than what 26.7.25.1 needed, so this build declares Common/Utilities >= 26.5.15.1 again — services adopt only the ClockSkew change, no Common/Utilities bump. Functionally identical to 26.8.26.1.",
